  "audio_relevance": 8,
  "difficulty": "beginner",
  "markdown": "# target_include_directories\n\nAdd include directories to a target for header resolution.\n\n## Syntax\n\n```cmake\ntarget_include_directories(<target>\n    [SYSTEM] [PRIVATE|PUBLIC|INTERFACE] <dir>...\n)\n```\n\n### Visibility Keywords\n\n- **PRIVATE** - Include path only for this target\n- **PUBLIC** - Include path for this target and dependents\n- **INTERFACE** - Include path only for dependents\n\n## JUCE Project Example\n\n```cmake\ntarget_include_directories(MyPlugin\n    PRIVATE\n        ${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/Source\n        ${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/DSP\n    PUBLIC\n        ${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/include  # Exposed in headers\n)\n```\n\n## FetchContent Pattern\n\n```cmake\nInclude(FetchContent)\nFetchContent_Declare(\n    JUCE\n    GIT_REPOSITORY https://github.com/juce-framework/JUCE.git\n    GIT_TAG origin/master\n)\nFetchContent_MakeAvailable(JUCE)\n\n# JUCE automatically sets up include paths\ntarget_link_libraries(MyPlugin PRIVATE juce::juce_audio_processors)\n```\n\n## Third-Party Library Includes\n\n```cmake\n# For external libraries without CMake support\nfind_path(STB_INCLUDE_DIR stb_vorbis.h)\n\ntarget_include_directories(MyPlugin\n    PRIVATE\n        ${STB_INCLUDE_DIR}\n)\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n```cmake\n# Use generator expressions for configuration-specific paths\ntarget_include_directories(MyPlugin\n    PRIVATE\n        $<BUILD_INTERFACE:${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/src>\n        $<INSTALL_INTERFACE:include>\n)\n```",
  "implementation_examples": [
    {
